                                                "sense_id": "51ddc2c9-adc1-304c-94b6-f80c73835d34",
                                                "text": "Some of them are, or were, libertarians, but of a kind to make the respectably bourgeois Libertarian Party cringe - people like Samuel Edward Konkin III, whose revolutionary “agorism” or pure free-market anarchism is supposed to abolish and liberate the working class; […]"
